SUMMARY:Rev Tor’s 30th Anniversary Jam
LOCATION:Colonial Theatre\, 111 South St\, Pittsfield\, MA 01201
DESCRIPTION:Rev Tor returns to The Colonial stage to celebrate 30 years! Si
 nce 1996\, Rev Tor has been a consistent presence on the East Coast club a
 nd festival circuit\, performing from Maine to Key West. Tor and his band 
 have shared the stage with members of The Grateful Dead\, Dead & Co.\, Phi
 sh\, The Allman Brothers Band and New Riders of the Purple Sage. Over his 
 30+ year career\, he has also appeared at festivals and concerts alongside
  artists such as Leon Russell\, Los Lobos\, String Cheese Incident and man
 y others.\nhttps://www.berkshiretheatregroup.org/event/rev-tors-30th-anniv
 ersary-jam/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
