SUMMARY:BeauSoleil with Michael Doucet
LOCATION:Iron Horse\, 18 Center St\, Northampton\, MA 01060
DESCRIPTION:For the past 50 years\, BeauSoleil avec Michael Doucet has been
  making some of the most potent and popular Cajun music on the planet. Bor
 n out of the rich Acadian ancestry of its members\, and created and driven
  by bandleader Michael Doucet’s spellbinding fiddle playing and soulful 
 vocals\, BeauSoleil is notorious for bringing even the most staid audience
  to its feet. BeauSoleil’s distinctive sound derives from the distilled 
 spirits of New Orleans jazz\, blues rock\, folk\, swamp pop\, Zydeco\, cou
 ntry and bluegrass\, captivating listeners from the Jazz and Heritage Fest
 ival in New Orleans\, to Carnegie Hall\, then all the way across the pond 
 to Richard Thompson’s Meltdown Festival in England.\nhttps://theparlorro
 om.my.salesforce-sites.com/ticket/#/events/a0SV500000BVCUnMAP\nFrom Pushpi
 n Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://theparlorroom.my.salesforce-sites.com/ticket/#/events/a0SV50000
 0BVCUnMAP
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:b527d951d51906e491b428ed0d63ca331178bea4@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20260919T013100Z
DTSTART:20261008T233000Z
DTEND:20261009T013000Z
SUMMARY:Cantrip
LOCATION:Parlor Room\, 32 Masonic St\, Northampton\, MA 01060
DESCRIPTION:The name Cantrip is an Old Scots word meaning a charm\, magic s
 pell or piece of mischief and it aptly describes the unexpected twists and
  turns in their musical arrangements\, likewise the compelling potency of 
 their musicianship. Swirling border pipes\, raging fiddle\, thunderous gui
 tar and three rich voices blend to create a sound energetic enough to tear
  the roof off. After 20 years of touring\, Cantrip has found a character l
 ike no other. Echoes can be heard of trad music from the 1960s and 70s\, b
 ut the years have slowly infested their music with the sounds of funk\, me
 tal\, bluegrass\, swing\, and even klezmer. Dan Houghton\, Jon Bews\, Alas
 dair White\, and Eric McDonald stir the elements in a witches’ cauldron\
 , slowly coalescing into chaotic order.\nhttps://theparlorroom.my.salesfor
 ce-sites.com/ticket/#/events/a0SV500000BwfinMAB\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass
 : https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://theparlorroom.my.salesforce-sites.com/ticket/#/events/a0SV50000
 0BwfinMAB
END:VEVENT
