LOCATION:Parlor Room\, 32 Masonic St\, Northampton\, MA 01060
DESCRIPTION:Skye Consort & Emma Björling perform whirling polskas\, groovy
  reels\, passionate love songs and breathtaking hymns all found in or insp
 ired by music from Scandinavia\, The British Isles\, French Canada and the
  New World. Their trans-Atlantic arrangements and original compositions sp
