SUMMARY:Tab Benoit
LOCATION:Academy of Music\, 274 Main St\, Northampton\, MA 01060
DESCRIPTION:with Ghalia Volt - Soul of the Swamp Tour\nGhalia Volt is a mod
 ern blues artist whose time has come. With her relentless drive\, captivat
 ing stage presence\, and ability to command audiences in both solo and ful
 l-band settings\, Volt has emerged as a rising force on the international 
 blues scene. Originally from Belgium and now rooted in the American South\
 , Volt bridges the gap between tradition and innovation\, blending the gri
 t of Hill Country blues with the raw energy of rock and roll. Whether perf
 orming with her powerful trio or as a One Woman Band\, her shows are an un
 forgettable journey through the blues\, infused with passion\, authenticit
 y\, and an undeniable mystique.\nhttps://aomtheatre.com/aom_event/tab-beno
 it-w-ghalia-volt-soul-of-the-swamp-tour/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https
 ://pushpin.city/westernma/
