SUMMARY:ALOK: Eat Pray Leave Tour
LOCATION:Iron Horse\, 18 Center St\, Northampton\, MA 01060
DESCRIPTION:ALOK (they/them) is an internationally acclaimed poet\, comedia
 n\, public speaker\, and actor. ALOK’s literary works “Beyond the Gend
 er Binary\,” “Femme in Public\,” and “Your Wound\, My Garden\,” 
 have garnered global recognition. Their dynamic presence has captivated au
 diences in over 40 countries\, with sold-out shows at the Edinburgh Fringe
  Festival and the Netflix is a Joke Festival. ALOK's first comedy special 
 BIOLOGY! [ was executive produced by Christopher Guest. They are the subje
